meta {
  name: Delete User
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

delete {
  url: {{backendUrl}}/api/admin/users/{{adminUserId}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  Admin-only. DESTRUCTIVE AND IRREVERSIBLE - permanently deletes any
  user by id and, via cascading foreign keys, all of their backlog
  entries and categories. Run auth/Login with an is_admin=true account,
  then "Create User", first so adminUserId points at a disposable test
  account rather than a real one.

  204 on success, 404 if no user has that id.
}
